{"unit_id":"6-debug-6__dsh-thinking-notifier#card-zh","repo":"6-debug-6/dsh-thinking-notifier","commit":"7f12b7411bc660906bfdae0f5294175724ea785a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-thinking-notifier 是一款面向 DSH Web 的桌面状态提醒插件。它在 DSH 主机进程中跟踪会话事件，并通过本机 HTTP 状态服务驱动置顶悬浮窗。悬浮窗显示 AI 正在思考、请求权限、等待用户选择或完成思考等状态，也汇总多个会话并展示计时与问题选项。适合希望切换到其他应用时仍能留意 DSH 运行状态的用户。需要运行 DSH Web 和桌面环境；Windows 使用 PowerShell/WPF，macOS 或 Linux 使用 Python 3 与 tkinter。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:575-635","lib/index.js:438-483","desktop-popup.py:69-89","desktop-popup.ps1:36-40"]}
{"unit_id":"6-debug-6__dsh-thinking-notifier#card-en","repo":"6-debug-6/dsh-thinking-notifier","commit":"7f12b7411bc660906bfdae0f5294175724ea785a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-thinking-notifier shows DSH session activity in an always-on-top desktop popup. It tracks thinking, permission requests, questions and completions, serving status locally to Windows PowerShell/WPF or Python/tkinter. It summarizes sessions and timers. Requires DSH Web and a desktop environment.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:575-635","lib/index.js:438-483","desktop-popup.py:69-89","desktop-popup.ps1:36-40"]}
