{"unit_id":"6-debug-6__dsh-thinking-notifier#caveat-1","repo":"6-debug-6/dsh-thinking-notifier","commit":"7f12b7411bc660906bfdae0f5294175724ea785a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-thinking-notifier 会在本机 127.0.0.1 启动状态 HTTP 服务，并将状态供本机桌面弹窗读取；默认端口为 7389，可通过环境变量调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-23","lib/index.js:438-483","desktop-popup.py:20-27"]}
